# Every .env variant, not just two. The managed store's READ-WRITE token would live
# in one of these, and .env.production / .env.development.local were committable
# before this widened. docs/2.0/SNAPSHOT.md.
.env*
!.env.example
!apps/web/.env.example
.DS_Store
